OL,3,AMove to rejoin EU among options for UK,
OL,4,ABurnham tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham says rejoining the EU is
OL,7,Famong options the government could look
OL,8,Fat - telling Radio 4's Today programme
OL,9,FBrexit has caused "more harm than good"
OL,11,FHe says: "We could stay as we are... we
OL,12,Fcould look at what George Osborne has
OL,13,Fsaid about a customs union, we could
OL,14,Flook at what the Liberal Democrats said
OL,15,Fat their conference about the single
OL,16,Fmarket, or we could go all the way - so
OL,17,Fthere are clearly options"
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
