OL,3,AMove to rejoin EU among options for UK,
OL,4,ABurnham tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Burnham's conference speech, the PM
OL,7,Fsaid his government will end the
OL,8,Fexisting triple lock on state pensions
OL,9,Ffrom 2030 to help fund social care
OL,10,Freforms in England
OL,12,F"Triple lock" means the state pension
OL,13,Fcurrently increases annually in line
OL,14,Fwith inflation, average wage growth, or
OL,15,F2.5% - whichever is highest
OL,17,FBut, from April 2030, the annual
OL,18,Fearnings link will be dropped which the
OL,19,Fgovernment thinks could save #15bn a
OL,20,Fyear by 2040 - here's what else Burnham
OL,21,Fannounced
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
