OL,3,AMove to rejoin EU among options for UK,
OL,4,ABurnham tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FTory chair Kevin Hollinrake criticises
OL,7,Fthe proposal, saying it amounts to
OL,8,F"taking money out of the pocket of
OL,9,Fpensioners and using it elsewhere in
OL,10,Fthe system"
